{
 "AUTOMATED|This frequency is no longer monitored. This frequency is no longer monitored.": {
  "dur": 5.2,
  "file": "automated_e52c600763.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Bastion, Battery. Second section's laid and ready. More tubes on every mission.": {
  "dur": 4.34,
  "file": "battery_11964b72db.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Fire direction's set up properly now. We'll turn your calls around faster.": {
  "dur": 3.94,
  "file": "battery_29d0b25b88.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Heavy charges are in. A bigger bang where you want it.": {
  "dur": 3.38,
  "file": "battery_3561bed126.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Eight rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.06,
  "file": "battery_01671b390b.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Four rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.7,
  "file": "battery_fa197285fd.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Six rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.54,
  "file": "battery_fcec00a640.ogg"
 },
 "BATTERY|Shot, over. Ten rounds HE, splash in three.": {
  "dur": 3.5,
  "file": "battery_05d06ca6ef.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|...all stations, Bastion-3 has fallen. Bastion-5 is not responding.": {
  "dur": 6.54,
  "file": "command_6223956d9e.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, Command. Fog bank moving up the valley. Expect visibility near zero.": {
  "dur": 6.22,
  "file": "command_6bca788847.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, Command. The bridge at Halden is down. Nobody leaves that valley by road now. Keep the gate shut.": {
  "dur": 8.652,
  "file": "command_517569d2df.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, Command. You now have a one-oh-five battery on call. Call a fire mission wherever you need it.": {
  "dur": 7.117,
  "file": "command_f4433a7a5e.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, airdrop of fuel and ammunition inbound at dawn. Mark your drop zone.": {
  "dur": 6.02,
  "file": "command_65935c0edd.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7, this is Command. Extraction is set for the seventy-second hour. Hold until then.": {
  "dur": 8.02,
  "file": "command_7a601b0d60.ogg"
 },
 "COMMAND|Bastion-7... airframes are short... (static) ...the flight goes only for fifteen souls or more. Keep your people alive.": {
  "dur": 10.94,
  "file": "command_2885a3d092.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|AP-T, belted and boxed. It'll go through two of them, maybe three.": {
  "dur": 5.46,
  "file": "cpl_voss_9532c4498a.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|Another crate of grenades. Pins in, please.": {
  "dur": 3.46,
  "file": "cpl_voss_629c46af8c.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|HE-I. Every round goes off when it hits. Don't drop that crate.": {
  "dur": 5.82,
  "file": "cpl_voss_5499872cd8.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|Incendiary belts. Anything you hit tonight might start burning.": {
  "dur": 4.1,
  "file": "cpl_voss_1bb6a2d537.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|Jacket's topped up. That barrel will run cooler tonight.": {
  "dur": 3.68,
  "file": "cpl_voss_a0df05f2aa.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|More bottles. Don't ask what was in them before.": {
  "dur": 4.02,
  "file": "cpl_voss_48f9a89557.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|New barrel's on the bench, Sarge. Headspace and timing are set.": {
  "dur": 4.26,
  "file": "cpl_voss_ee688034c0.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|Stiffer buffer spring's in. She'll cycle faster, so mind the heat.": {
  "dur": 3.976,
  "file": "cpl_voss_e952a58024.ogg"
 },
 "CPL. VOSS|Thickened the fuel with soap flakes. It sticks now.": {
  "dur": 4.06,
  "file": "cpl_voss_f8cacc4e65.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Bastion-7, Hammer one-one is on call tonight. Throw a red flare where you want it, and keep your heads down.": {
  "dur": 6.256,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_c9eefeb3b1.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Bomb impact. Hammer one-one off target, re-arming.": {
  "dur": 3.24,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_dd3e25010d.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Copy red flare. Hammer one-one is in hot — keep your heads down.": {
  "dur": 3.92,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_23b4f47e25.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Good effect on target. That's a lot of them down. Hammer one-one off and climbing.": {
  "dur": 4.72,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_eafa8f7e5a.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Hammer flight, in hot. Walking it up the valley. Bombs away, bombs away.": {
  "dur": 4.56,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_16b07744af.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Hammer one-one, I have your red smoke. One GBU, danger close. Heads down, Bastion.": {
  "dur": 6.24,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_cb0268eb3f.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Hammer one-one, tally your mark. Two-thousand pounder inbound, ten seconds.": {
  "dur": 5.2,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_4274760056.ogg"
 },
 "HAMMER 1-1|Shack. Direct hit on your mark. Hammer one-one off target.": {
  "dur": 3.92,
  "file": "hammer_1_1_cac7a97c07.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|Bastion-7, Hollis! I've got a truck full of people from Halden and half the valley on my bumper. Open the gate!": {
  "dur": 6.229,
  "file": "lt_hollis_8453b48a1f.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|Bastion-7, this is Hollis, Recon Two. Four of us coming in hot down the road — they're right behind us. Cover us!": {
  "dur": 7.947,
  "file": "lt_hollis_332db6f3d7.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|Man down! Keep moving, keep moving!": {
  "dur": 3.042,
  "file": "lt_hollis_eefb9a9900.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|We're in! We're in. Bastion-7, I owe every one of you a drink.": {
  "dur": 4.68,
  "file": "lt_hollis_69309da3c0.ogg"
 },
 "LT. HOLLIS|We're through the gate. Thanks for the cover, Bastion. Recon Two will take a spot on the wall.": {
  "dur": 5.627,
  "file": "lt_hollis_e1874e2dd0.ogg"
 },
 "NARRATOR|A column of bloaters walked down the road like a funeral procession. We burst them in the field, one after another, and the valley stank of it for days.": {
  "dur": 10.74,
  "file": "narrator_facbee4b92.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|A fuel tanker stood abandoned on the road all night. The dead shuffled past it, and we never found the moment to light it.": {
  "dur": 10.196,
  "file": "narrator_f2d89cbfd0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|A fuel tanker stood abandoned on the road. We waited until they crowded round it, and then we lit it, and for a moment it was day.": {
  "dur": 10.301,
  "file": "narrator_ac272753fc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|A herd of brutes came down the flank in a stampede, and the wall shuddered under their weight. It held. Barely.": {
  "dur": 10.14,
  "file": "narrator_ec929eca39.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Against everything the valley had, not one man fell. Aran swore it would be the story he told his children.": {
  "dur": 8.31,
  "file": "narrator_a22efb7df9.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And for as long as there was anyone left to man the wall... it held.": {
  "dur": 5.18,
  "file": "narrator_2c7eb57b6d.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And for seventy-two hours... it held.": {
  "dur": 5.66,
  "file": "narrator_14d9b035cb.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then it came — the biggest of them all. It reached our wall, and for a long moment I thought the whole line would come down with it. It didn't. It fell.": {
  "dur": 13.7,
  "file": "narrator_1cafff97fd.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then it came — the biggest of them all. We threw everything we had left at it, and somehow, out there in the field, it fell.": {
  "dur": 13.358,
  "file": "narrator_4938152ca2.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|And then the sun rose on the seventy-second hour. No aircraft came over the ridge. But we were still there.": {
  "dur": 8.82,
  "file": "narrator_bc141dcebb.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Another morning on the wall. Tomorrow they would come again. So would we.": {
  "dur": 5.824,
  "file": "narrator_c83bbc9b2e.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Another night came, as they always did, and the dead came with it.": {
  "dur": 5.66,
  "file": "narrator_6f1664f6d1.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Around the strobe, the gun laid them down in a ring, row after row, like a fence made of the dead.": {
  "dur": 8.34,
  "file": "narrator_aed996d5ac.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn the gate was still shut. Whatever we had heard out there in the dark, we never opened it.": {
  "dur": 5.639,
  "file": "narrator_4a226c72c3.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn, Aran told the sergeant it had been an honour. Kovac told him to save it. One more night.": {
  "dur": 7.371,
  "file": "narrator_891d5d9bc6.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|At dawn, Kovac counted heads twice, and chalked the number on the wall where everyone could see it.": {
  "dur": 6.82,
  "file": "narrator_d7ae8938bc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Bastion-7 went quiet that night. The dead came over the wall like water through a broken dam, and the last light on the line went out.": {
  "dur": 10.587,
  "file": "narrator_85dbc12784.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By dawn there were so few of us left that we stood further apart, so that from the valley, the wall would still look manned.": {
  "dur": 10.86,
  "file": "narrator_dfe6d08385.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By morning the radio was quiet. Kovac sat beside it for a long time, listening to the static.": {
  "dur": 7.1,
  "file": "narrator_21363998c0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By the seventh night, Command had stopped answering. Out on the horizon, the city's fires were going out.": {
  "dur": 7.556,
  "file": "narrator_247ed528aa.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|By the time the dead came down the valley again, nobody called it Bastion-7. They called it the Last Bastion.": {
  "dur": 8.38,
  "file": "narrator_60c79aa5e2.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Command had called us Bastion-7, one light in a line of many. But there was no line anymore. There were no other lights.": {
  "dur": 10.036,
  "file": "narrator_9de8f4b4b9.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Command had called us Bastion-7. The people we carried out of that valley called it something else. They called it the Last Bastion.": {
  "dur": 9.671,
  "file": "narrator_36b4a3a034.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Dawn. We counted the living, then the dead, and then we stopped counting.": {
  "dur": 7.02,
  "file": "narrator_d46968dfe0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Even with the giant on the field, the gun never stopped talking. The smaller dead fell in heaps around its feet.": {
  "dur": 7.324,
  "file": "narrator_abf90fb082.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Every man came back from the fourth night. The crows went hungry, for once.": {
  "dur": 5.32,
  "file": "narrator_7c09846b47.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Every night the sun went down behind the burning city. And every night, the dead came out of it.": {
  "dur": 8.74,
  "file": "narrator_af1d7bd675.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Everything we had, we gave. Some of us gave all of it. Their rifles stayed on the parapet where they fell.": {
  "dur": 9.94,
  "file": "narrator_95b852925a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Extraction at the seventy-second hour, Command had said. Fifteen souls, or the birds would not fly. The hour came, and the sky stayed empty.": {
  "dur": 14.7,
  "file": "narrator_0a44d46f95.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|For ten nights we had held that wall. Now we ran from it, past the fires, toward the red light at the back of the ramp.": {
  "dur": 7.98,
  "file": "narrator_bf1630a0ea.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Hollis came back that night with a truck full of strangers from Halden. The dead stopped it on the road, short of the gate, and we could not clear them fast enough.": {
  "dur": 11.246,
  "file": "narrator_711fda2f87.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Hollis came back that night, driving a truck full of strangers from Halden. We cleared the road in front of him, and he drove it straight through the gate.": {
  "dur": 9.22,
  "file": "narrator_f12f9e7d33.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|In the blackout, our fires were the only light on the field. We could watch them burn, and that was all we could see.": {
  "dur": 8.22,
  "file": "narrator_2be95f01a1.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|In the dark, the gun was our only light. Every time it spoke, a dozen of them stopped coming.": {
  "dur": 7.444,
  "file": "narrator_b7a8317c58.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|In the fog, we only knew a man was gone when he stopped answering. We called their names until dawn.": {
  "dur": 6.7,
  "file": "narrator_9a77ca344e.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Kovac kept broadcasting anyway. Every hour, on every channel the set could reach, the same four words.": {
  "dur": 9.663,
  "file": "narrator_fa27bb56bc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|No one was left to write it down. The gun fell silent before the dawn, and in the morning, the valley belonged to the dead.": {
  "dur": 10.98,
  "file": "narrator_e8f996f5c0.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Nobody was taken out of the fog that night. When it lifted, we counted heads twice to be sure.": {
  "dur": 6.74,
  "file": "narrator_92b404fa8a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Not one name was added to the list that night. On that wall, it was as close to a miracle as we ever came.": {
  "dur": 7.86,
  "file": "narrator_e7970c8e4e.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Not one of us fell on the giant's night. Afterwards we sat in the dark, too tired even to talk about it.": {
  "dur": 8.1,
  "file": "narrator_8fc598ef98.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the eighth night, a recorded voice told us that no one was listening anymore. We kept talking anyway.": {
  "dur": 8.34,
  "file": "narrator_d730841fa8.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the fifth night, Bastion-3 fell, and Bastion-5 went silent. We were the last lights left on the line.": {
  "dur": 9.66,
  "file": "narrator_bc4aa25a8f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the first night, the dead came down the valley in their thousands. Bastion-7 answered them with one gun.": {
  "dur": 9.663,
  "file": "narrator_713efb409f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the fourth night, Command promised us an airdrop. The bloaters came down the valley to meet it.": {
  "dur": 8.252,
  "file": "narrator_6d550860f4.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the last night the gun spoke for all of us, and whatever came down that valley did not go back up it.": {
  "dur": 6.78,
  "file": "narrator_78d057fe79.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the last night we set the valley floor alight, and it burned the way the city once had.": {
  "dur": 5.978,
  "file": "narrator_3a0f75f2bc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the last night, every man who had made it this far made it to the end.": {
  "dur": 6.78,
  "file": "narrator_5bc9e62680.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the ninth night, the biggest horde we had ever seen filled the valley from the wall to the ridge. We gave it everything.": {
  "dur": 9.266,
  "file": "narrator_c42d9adddf.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the second night, word came that the bridge at Halden was down. There was no road out of the valley any more. Only the sky, we told ourselves.": {
  "dur": 12.66,
  "file": "narrator_d0193d13e7.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|On the sixth night, Command told us the birds would only fly for fifteen souls or more. After that, we counted heads every hour.": {
  "dur": 11.535,
  "file": "narrator_8644e21506.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Ours was the seventh. A wall of concrete across the road, a gate, one heavy gun, and whoever was left to man it.": {
  "dur": 10.452,
  "file": "narrator_3827438bbf.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two came down the road with half the valley at their heels. Every one of them made it through the gate.": {
  "dur": 8.36,
  "file": "narrator_54c3cf0e87.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two died on the road, a few hundred metres from the gate. We watched every moment of it through the sights.": {
  "dur": 9.26,
  "file": "narrator_1cd49f5552.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Recon Two ran the last mile under our guns. Not all of them reached the gate, and the ones who did never spoke of the others.": {
  "dur": 8.468,
  "file": "narrator_3b2bf21e2a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Seventy-two hours, Command told us. Hold the valley for seventy-two hours, and the birds would come for us.": {
  "dur": 7.764,
  "file": "narrator_4365f0c91c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Some of the men who went down under the stampede never got back up. We heard the brutes long after they had stopped.": {
  "dur": 7.54,
  "file": "narrator_79f171a946.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Some of us came so close to the end. Seventy-one hours, and then the night took them anyway.": {
  "dur": 7.5,
  "file": "narrator_942d2e896f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Somewhere past midnight the gun found its rhythm, and the dead went down in rows, like wheat before the scythe.": {
  "dur": 8.38,
  "file": "narrator_3ecb28a090.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Somewhere past midnight the gun found its rhythm. Kovac said he had never seen a fifty worked like that.": {
  "dur": 7.98,
  "file": "narrator_d2a654b059.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Spectre was not the only loss that night. By dawn, the wall had names of its own to add to theirs.": {
  "dur": 7.18,
  "file": "narrator_8e57f51e32.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Spectre went down that night. We watched it fall burning into the hills, and after that there was no one above us but God.": {
  "dur": 8.62,
  "file": "narrator_197408816c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That first night, there was only the wall, the dark, and the gun.": {
  "dur": 5.66,
  "file": "narrator_4388729f9a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That morning the city on the horizon lay dark and still. There was nothing left in it to burn.": {
  "dur": 7.3,
  "file": "narrator_771b142862.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That morning we understood that there was no line anymore. There was only us.": {
  "dur": 6.477,
  "file": "narrator_4790dd0bca.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That night the gun fired until the belts ran out, and then we fed it more, and the valley went quiet in rows.": {
  "dur": 7.553,
  "file": "narrator_be49440e0d.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|That night they found the way round, down over the rocks at the end of the wall, where nobody had thought to look.": {
  "dur": 8.552,
  "file": "narrator_9fff523b87.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The brutes came through the fire without slowing. They just burned as they came.": {
  "dur": 6.38,
  "file": "narrator_14ab15f139.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The crate came down in the field, and the dead tore it open like a carcass. We watched our supplies scatter in the mud.": {
  "dur": 9.06,
  "file": "narrator_d01ea70395.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The crate came down under a grey canopy, and we held the field around it until the recovery team dragged it home. Ammunition, bottles, and a little hope.": {
  "dur": 10.1,
  "file": "narrator_5f83080b6c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The first names went on the list that night. Kovac wrote them himself, in pencil, so the rain wouldn't run them.": {
  "dur": 8.879,
  "file": "narrator_16bdf4aa7d.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The fourth dawn came up cold and red. The crows had learned where to find us.": {
  "dur": 5.703,
  "file": "narrator_63c05f11bc.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The giant took men off the wall like a child takes toys from a shelf. We stopped looking at the empty places.": {
  "dur": 8.3,
  "file": "narrator_407d8d4819.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The overpass road burned all night. Whatever walked it to reach us burned with it.": {
  "dur": 7.38,
  "file": "narrator_69ff9484a5.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The people from the overpass ran for our lights. None of them reached the gate. Their voices stopped, one by one, out on the open road.": {
  "dur": 10.42,
  "file": "narrator_317cb1c295.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The people from the overpass ran for our lights. Some of them made it inside. The mother would never say the names of the others.": {
  "dur": 7.78,
  "file": "narrator_3c44dba488.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The stampede broke on the wall and never got over it. Every one of us was still there at roll call.": {
  "dur": 7.7,
  "file": "narrator_906b369924.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The sun rose again. It did not care who was still alive to see it.": {
  "dur": 5.58,
  "file": "narrator_a263564089.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The tenth night. The seventy-second hour. The last night — if the promises had ever meant anything at all.": {
  "dur": 8.245,
  "file": "narrator_c9e03b902f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The third night began with a woman's voice on the radio, begging for help that we could not give.": {
  "dur": 7.38,
  "file": "narrator_c7bff8018f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The wall base burned all night. The dead walked into the flames screaming, and kept on walking, until they didn't.": {
  "dur": 6.7,
  "file": "narrator_5c7a7c9820.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The wall base burned under the giant's feet. Even it screamed when the fuel caught.": {
  "dur": 5.66,
  "file": "narrator_755c48682f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The wall took a terrible toll that night. By morning there were empty places all along the walkway, and nobody spoke of them.": {
  "dur": 9.476,
  "file": "narrator_0452be70b1.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|The woman from the overpass found our lights. She brought every one of those children through the gate alive. For one night, the wall meant something.": {
  "dur": 12.74,
  "file": "narrator_ac7df404cf.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the first giant came down the road, as tall as the wall itself. It fell in the open field, and the whole valley shook when it hit the ground.": {
  "dur": 9.255,
  "file": "narrator_40207f688f.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the first giant came. It reached the wall and tore at the concrete with its bare hands, and the bastion shook, until at last we brought it down.": {
  "dur": 11.38,
  "file": "narrator_da926b9893.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the fog rolled up the valley, thick as wet wool, and the dead walked out of it close enough to touch. We fired at shadows.": {
  "dur": 8.925,
  "file": "narrator_6665a5d576.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Then the generator died, and the lights went out all along the wall. We fought on in the dark, by flare-light and muzzle flash.": {
  "dur": 8.66,
  "file": "narrator_c9e346faff.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|There were no more orders and no more promises. Only the wall, the night, and the gun.": {
  "dur": 8.919,
  "file": "narrator_c6cfd049fb.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|They came all through that morning. Out of the hills, up the road, out of the dead city. Families. Stragglers. Soldiers with no unit left to go back to. The gate that had stayed shut for ten nights stood open until noon.": {
  "dur": 19.098,
  "file": "narrator_c67a7a1669.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|They came out of the fog in columns, and the gun cut them down before they ever saw the wall.": {
  "dur": 6.22,
  "file": "narrator_d4bfd8da2a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|Under the stampede, the gun chewed through the runners until the barrel glowed like a stove.": {
  "dur": 5.926,
  "file": "narrator_3adbbb2111.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We buried our own beside the road that night, facing the overpass, as if they could still keep watch for her.": {
  "dur": 8.9,
  "file": "narrator_d3f3fcc55a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We came through the dark without losing a soul. Kovac said it was the first good luck we'd had in a week.": {
  "dur": 6.9,
  "file": "narrator_4ab42123b5.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We had all come through the first night alive. We thought, God help us, that it might always be like that.": {
  "dur": 7.7,
  "file": "narrator_e2b59e16cb.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We had stopped counting the nights. The dead had not stopped coming.": {
  "dur": 5.58,
  "file": "narrator_1d49d6f50c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We left the gun on the wall, still pointed down the valley. By the time we cleared the ridge, the dead were on the walkway where we had stood.": {
  "dur": 9.86,
  "file": "narrator_71aeeafb01.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We lost good men on the walkway that night. We buried them at first light, beside the others.": {
  "dur": 7.311,
  "file": "narrator_a3fa01a810.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We lost men in the dark that night, and in the dark we could not even see who. We found out at roll call.": {
  "dur": 8.66,
  "file": "narrator_1461a8f419.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We lost no one on the wall that night. It didn't feel like a victory, with her voice still in our ears.": {
  "dur": 8.58,
  "file": "narrator_1ee265a8ea.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We paid for the fourth night in men, not supplies. The crate came cheaper than they did.": {
  "dur": 6.756,
  "file": "narrator_2ad8165493.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We ringed the drop zone with fire, and the dead walked into it rather than give up the crate.": {
  "dur": 7.34,
  "file": "narrator_bd86ee54e9.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We set the fog itself on fire. The bottles burst in the white, and the dead walked out of it burning.": {
  "dur": 8.841,
  "file": "narrator_394b20ac87.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|We threw every bottle we had. The foot of the wall was one long fire, and still they kept walking into it.": {
  "dur": 7.063,
  "file": "narrator_8e0f63a7b5.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the cities fell, Command drew a line across the hills: a string of walls on the valley roads, to hold the dead back while the last flights got out.": {
  "dur": 13.74,
  "file": "narrator_3f9bdf7306.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the column from the overpass road came for the wall, the fifty swept the road clean from end to end.": {
  "dur": 8.012,
  "file": "narrator_0f03272989.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the sun came up, the valley was grey with bodies. Seventy-two hours, Command had said. Sixty-four to go.": {
  "dur": 10.307,
  "file": "narrator_89e2c9e21a.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the sun came up, we said it to each other, one by one, all along the line. Bastion-7 is holding.": {
  "dur": 9.007,
  "file": "narrator_89f9b1f427.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|When the wall was lost, we called the guns down on our own heads. Three of ours died in that fire. The wall held.": {
  "dur": 9.577,
  "file": "narrator_6ea69fdd38.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|With Spectre gone, the fire did its work for it. The foot of the wall burned from dusk until the sky went grey.": {
  "dur": 8.78,
  "file": "narrator_cbe1c82906.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|With Spectre gone, we lost no one else that night. It felt as if the dead were giving us a moment to mourn.": {
  "dur": 7.06,
  "file": "narrator_4ea021cc41.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NARRATOR|With no one above us any more, the fifty did Spectre's work as well as its own. The field was grey with them.": {
  "dur": 7.46,
  "file": "narrator_90cf2afa2c.ogg",
  "sr": 24000
 },
 "NIGHTINGALE|Bastion-7, Nightingale. Extraction flight is airborne, three lifters and escort. Hold that wall until we are overhead.": {
  "dur": 8.837,
  "file": "nightingale_16a2fef36a.ogg"
 },
 "NIGHTINGALE|Bastion-7, Nightingale. We are over the ridge. Hammer flight, you are cleared hot. Everything past the wire.": {
  "dur": 6.98,
  "file": "nightingale_5c183622bf.ogg"
 },
 "NIGHTINGALE|Nightingale is on the ground. Ramp is down. Move, move, move!": {
  "dur": 4.117,
  "file": "nightingale_1d98e30eb3.ogg"
 },
 "NIGHTINGALE|Nightingale, two minutes out. Hammer flight is with us. Keep them off that wall, Bastion.": {
  "dur": 6.86,
  "file": "nightingale_2d7e3d66a3.ogg"
 },
 "NIGHTINGALE|Ten seconds, Bastion. Get your heads down.": {
  "dur": 3.196,
  "file": "nightingale_cf7a308009.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Claymores going out. Front toward enemy, I checked twice.": {
  "dur": 3.82,
  "file": "pvt_aran_0d555fe13d.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|I stopped writing their names down.": {
  "dur": 2.529,
  "file": "pvt_aran_9f75de4bcc.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|More wire going out, Sarge. Mind your feet past the ditch.": {
  "dur": 4.7,
  "file": "pvt_aran_b070a45cc5.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Sarge, if this is it... it was an honour.": {
  "dur": 3.66,
  "file": "pvt_aran_36b26a8e49.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Sarge... sun's going down.": {
  "dur": 2.42,
  "file": "pvt_aran_11165f1c65.ogg"
 },
 "PVT. ARAN|Sarge... the city stopped burning.": {
  "dur": 3.18,
  "file": "pvt_aran_9ac2b4e004.ogg"
 },
 "REACH 3-1|Bastion-7, Reach three-one, thirty seconds out with your resupply. Look for the strobe.": {
  "dur": 5.5,
  "file": "reach_3_1_521ecb2870.ogg"
 },
 "REACH 3-1|Load away, load away. Good chute. Reach three-one is clear — good luck down there.": {
  "dur": 6.38,
  "file": "reach_3_1_babe69a46c.ogg"
 },
 "REAPER 1-1|Bastion-7, Reaper one-one, inbound with the lifters. Forty seconds. Just hold on.": {
  "dur": 6.86,
  "file": "reaper_1_1_af15af7bbc.ogg"
 },
 "REAPER 1-1|Reaper one-one, on station. We have the wall. Anything that moves down there is ours.": {
  "dur": 5.42,
  "file": "reaper_1_1_d8157475be.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Another crew for the wall. Put them on a gun and keep them fed.": {
  "dur": 4.56,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d60fcd5357.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Another night. Another dawn.": {
  "dur": 3.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_1b26b08652.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Barrel's cooked!": {
  "dur": 1.462,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_0ac401ff1b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Big group coming down the valley!": {
  "dur": 2.36,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d69d50bbec.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Biggest one yet coming down the valley. Everything we have, tonight.": {
  "dur": 5.12,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_15415c55c3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Bloaters in the mix tonight. Don't let them touch the wall.": {
  "dur": 3.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_185b0b7aa7.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Bloaters! A whole column of them on the road — pop them before they reach the wall!": {
  "dur": 5.502,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_23f61fb001.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Breach! We lost someone!": {
  "dur": 3.442,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_a71307f29f.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Bring it down on them! Everyone off the wall — get your heads down!": {
  "dur": 4.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_1a40ba1826.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Brutes! A whole herd of them — left flank!": {
  "dur": 3.745,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_cfec691662.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Brutes! A whole herd of them — right flank!": {
  "dur": 3.2,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_fa98a6ff96.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Civilians on the road. Hold your fire on them and cover them all the way to the gate!": {
  "dur": 4.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b33ed935dd.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Command hasn't answered since 0300. I'm sure it's the antenna.": {
  "dur": 5.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_487efb2421.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Count the survivors. Then count the dead out there. Keep counting.": {
  "dur": 5.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4b650e095b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Crate's down in the field! Keep them off it until the recovery team gets out there!": {
  "dur": 5.28,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_fb8d9de8d1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Danger close! Everything on the wall line — God forgive us.": {
  "dur": 5.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_071b7828bc.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Dawn. Count the living.": {
  "dur": 2.821,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_87c9fb5671.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Engineers found a crate of bottles and a jerrycan in the depot. Put a Molotov on the wall base and let them burn. And there's a crate of grenades at your feet, for anything climbing.": {
  "dur": 12.6,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4443b5c9d8.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Everybody in? Squad, back inside — shut the gate!": {
  "dur": 3.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_cb6d717953.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Fifteen. You heard him. Nobody else dies on this wall.": {
  "dur": 4.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d8d33dd289.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Fog's lifting. Back to work.": {
  "dur": 3.128,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d9e75c0ba8.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Friendlies on the road! Kill what's chasing them — and watch your fire!": {
  "dur": 4.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_3259a5215c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Gate squad, out! Cover them in!": {
  "dur": 2.6,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_c345d9df80.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Generator's gone! We've lost the lights — pop flares!": {
  "dur": 3.52,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_039c7bfb33.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Got them. Every last one. Somebody find them some blankets.": {
  "dur": 6.64,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_ebf8d1728e.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Gun's too hot!": {
  "dur": 1.72,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8981f4493c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Here they come — dozens! Hundreds!": {
  "dur": 3.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_d28aaa65ba.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Horde inbound! Get on them!": {
  "dur": 2.48,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4c36c0c2f3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|If anyone is listening: Bastion-7 is holding. Bastion-7 is holding.": {
  "dur": 6.2,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_9632e1a304.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's at the wall! It's tearing the wall apart — kill it!": {
  "dur": 4.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_abd83878a8.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's down! The big one is down!": {
  "dur": 2.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4603f7ae98.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's down. Whatever that was, it's down.": {
  "dur": 4.72,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_130448e432.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|It's standing. Keep to the road and come in slow. We've got you covered.": {
  "dur": 5.88,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_fa4663dcfd.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Keep it up!": {
  "dur": 1,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_0f3cf8545b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Listen. If it all goes wrong, we can bring the guns down on our own wall line. It will cost us men. Use it only if the wall is lost.": {
  "dur": 11.56,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_1c164d6085.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Look at them burn!": {
  "dur": 2.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_3a364f69fc.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Man down at the gate! Pull back, pull back!": {
  "dur": 3.08,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_564e8c8fc1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Man down! They got in!": {
  "dur": 3,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_e3b10737c3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Movement on the ridge — it's a whole wave!": {
  "dur": 3.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_971743d1d3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Movement on the road. Here they come. Gunner — on the fifty.": {
  "dur": 4.629,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_1b268a8632.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|No birds. No orders. Just the night, and the gun.": {
  "dur": 7.322,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_15b471bedd.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|None of them made it. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 2.92,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b16aaf963e.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Open the gate — squad out, bring them home!": {
  "dur": 3.36,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_0b8f10c34a.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Overpass is forty klicks out. There's nothing we can do. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 4.88,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_7bc282411c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Power's back. Thank God.": {
  "dur": 2.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b87e9706e1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Recon Two is gone. Eyes front.": {
  "dur": 2.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8ea7d6c5a1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Recovery team has the crate! Flares, grenades, and the battery's reloaded.": {
  "dur": 4.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_012fb8622b.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Red smoke out! Get your heads down!": {
  "dur": 3.16,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_5ec18c8275.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Second squad, out the gate! Covering fire!": {
  "dur": 3.44,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_bfb8aa0a82.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Seventy-two hours, and not enough of us left to be worth a flight. Whatever comes down that valley — we are still here.": {
  "dur": 8.684,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_dc0584847a.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Seventy-two hours. This is the last night. Whatever comes down that valley — we are still here.": {
  "dur": 9.8,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_e5d31812b1.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Some of Recon Two made it in. Not all of them.": {
  "dur": 3.68,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_c2d2c39aba.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Something big coming down the road... my God, look at the size of it.": {
  "dur": 5.64,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_a364b3f7f9.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Spectre's down... God rest them. We're on our own up here.": {
  "dur": 6.715,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_b059171287.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Sun's up. We made it.": {
  "dur": 2.52,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_6a5e0e530d.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|That's a whole column gone!": {
  "dur": 2.24,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_f15586a445.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|That's all of them. Gate squad, pull back!": {
  "dur": 3.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4412808d0c.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|That's everyone. Bastion-7 is off the wall. Go, go!": {
  "dur": 5.32,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_65e276659f.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|That's not like the other one. That's bigger. Everything we have — put it on that thing!": {
  "dur": 7.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_321e273ef5.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|The crews spent the morning on the range. They'll shoot straighter tonight.": {
  "dur": 5.04,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_c850028d55.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|The tanker's gone up! Look at them burn!": {
  "dur": 3.12,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_ceafe0a492.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|The truck's stopped... they're all over it. God help them.": {
  "dur": 4.96,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_08f8d51c54.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Then they'll be up soon. Lights on. Everybody on the wall.": {
  "dur": 5.411,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4d8c398ce4.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|Then we monitor it. Bastion-7 is holding. Say it.": {
  "dur": 5.04,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_91a8492aaa.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|There's a fuel tanker stalled out on the road. Let them crowd around it, then put a burst through the tank.": {
  "dur": 6.76,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8d74ca31f3.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They know. God help us, they know we are leaving. Everything is coming over that ridge — hold!": {
  "dur": 6.04,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_8d74f76065.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They walked right past the tanker. Waste of good fuel.": {
  "dur": 4.84,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_a4fa31714d.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They'll come again tomorrow. So will we.": {
  "dur": 3.4,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_169ece1839.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They're all over the crate — clear them off!": {
  "dur": 2.56,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_4bae692eb5.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They're climbing! Clear that section!": {
  "dur": 2.6,
  "file": "sgt_kovac_ef232f76f0.ogg"
 },
 "SGT. KOVAC|They're coming over the rocks on the left! Swing that gun!": {
  "dur": 3.6,
